{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53723","headline":"答复礼禅师《真妄偈》（题拟） 二 · 宗密","name":"答复礼禅师《真妄偈》（题拟） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不是真生妄，妄迷真而起。\n悟妄本自真，知真妄即止。\n妄止似终末，悟来似初始。\n迷悟性皆空，皆空无终始。\n生死由此迷，达此出生死。\n（《林间录》卷上）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宗密","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53723.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53723","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}